     },
     "body": "<p>We should document this for both the Rest and SOAP apis.<br/>\nThe actual code in DefaultManagement says:</p>\n\n<p>        if (force) </p>\n{\n            throw new GeneralException(\"Forced object removal is not \"\n                    + \"yet supported.\");\n        }",
