      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>We want to eventually get rid of \"force\"</p>\n\n<p>Solution: </p>\n\n<p>If the next release has major SOAP api changes (like \n    <span class=\"jira-issue-macro resolved\" data-jira-key=\"FCREPO-521\" >\n                <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/browse/FCREPO-521\" class=\"jira-issue-macro-key issue-link\"  title=\"Merge API-A and M across the board, simplifying AuthN\" >\n            <img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10315?size=medium\" />\n            FCREPO-521\n        </a>\n                                                    <span class=\"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui-lozenge-success jira-macro-single-issue-export-pdf\">Closed</span>\n            </span>\n), drop force=true.</p>",
     "created": "05/Jan/10 2:20 PM",
     "id": "11206",
     "jsdPublic": true,
     "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/10545/comment/11206",
